NAME
    userdel - remove an account

SYNOPSIS
    userdel <name>

DESCRIPTION
    Removes <name> from the account directory - root only. Refuses to
    remove 'root' itself (the one account that always exists), and refuses
    to remove an account that's currently active in any live session (or
    this shell itself, with no session manager registered) - 'su' that
    session to another account first.

EXAMPLES
    userdel kid
